OL,3,GNEWSAFamily home to become Turkmenistan
OL,4,Aembassy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family home in west London is to
OL,7,Fbecome the Embassy of Turkmenistan.
OL,9,FKensington and Chelsea councillors have
OL,10,Fapproved plans to move the embassy from
OL,11,Fits current location at 131 Holland
OL,12,FPark Avenue to 53 Victoria Road in
OL,13,FKensington, with the Holland Park site
OL,14,Fdue to become the Tajikistan embassy.
OL,16,FThe council received eight letters of
OL,17,Fobjection citing concerns such as the
OL,18,Floss of a residential home in the
OL,19,Fborough.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
