OL,3,GNEWSAFamily home to become Turkmenistan
OL,4,Aembassy
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil planning officers acknowledged
OL,7,Fthe loss of residential accommodation
OL,8,Fbut said the site was located within an
OL,9,Farea "identified as suitable for
OL,10,Fdiplomatic and allied uses, with a
OL,11,Fnumber of established diplomatic
OL,12,Fpremises nearby".
